{
  "name": "List offline Windows endpoints in Nizlo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## Before you run\n\nUse an authorized test workspace and a Nizlo personal access token limited to `devices.view`. On the HTTP Request node, add a Header Auth credential named `Authorization` with value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`. Save it in n8n's credential store.\n\nThis manual workflow reads page 1 of up to 100 active Windows endpoints currently reported offline. `items` holds that page and `total` counts all matches. An empty list is valid.\n\n[Setup and expected output](https://izikipizi.github.io/nizlo-msp-operations-resources/n8n-rmm-integration.html?utm_source=n8n_workflow&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=n8n_offline_windows#built-in-offline-windows-template)"
      },
      "id": "7f42849b-d406-420a-a8eb-ea1285ab1566",
      "name": "Read this first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a7947997-12d5-4679-a7a2-4047a62dc438",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://app.nizlo.com/api/v1/devices",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "status",
              "value": "offline"
            },
            {
              "name": "platform",
              "value": "WINDOWS"
            },
            {
              "name": "view",
              "value": "summary"
            },
            {
              "name": "lifecycle",
              "value": "active"
            },
            {
              "name": "page",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "pageSize",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000,
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": false
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "e6c5b432-d949-44ba-8230-532c461ab541",
      "name": "Read offline Windows endpoints",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
